      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t it overall simpler to just have the code for these three tests one after another in checkSnapshot? It\u0027d avoid this map, checkSnapshotTestConfigurationInfo and allCheckSnapshotTestConfigurations altogether. You could instead use a local function there to reduce the duplication between the tests.",
